OL,3,GGrampian
OL,4,
OL,5,CFriday:FA mostly cloudy start with
OL,6,Fshowers. Showers will ease through the
OL,7,Fmorning leaving a mostly dry afternoon
OL,8,Fwith long sunny spells developing.
OL,9,
OL,10,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FMostly
OL,11,Fdry Saturday and Sunday with the odd
OL,12,Fshower possible and sunny spells, cold
OL,13,Fand frosty overnight. Monday may be
OL,14,Fcloudier with outbreaks of rain
OL,15,Fpossible later.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
